022,ko:\u0022Revision:\u0022},tze={en:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,fr:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,es:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,cn:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,it:\u0022Puoi inserire qualsiasi data nel campo Personalizzato, New Recruit trover\u00E0 automaticamente la versione del libro corrispondente alla data pi\u00F9 vicina.\u0022,de:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,ja:\u0022\u30AB\u30B9\u30BF\u30E0\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u30EB\u30C9\u306B\u4EFB\u610F\u306E\u65E5\u4ED8\u3092\u5165\u529B\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002New Recruit\u306F\u6700\u3082\u8FD1\u3044\u65E5\u4ED8\u306B\u4E00\u81F4\u3059\u308B\u672C\u306E\u30D0\u30FC\u30B8\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u81EA\u52D5\u7684\u306B\u898B\u3064\u3051\u307E\u3059\u3002\u0022,pl:\u0022Mo\u017Cesz wprowadzi\u0107 dowoln\u0105 dat\u0119 w polu Niestandardowe, New Recruit automatycznie znajdzie wersj\u0119 ksi\u0105\u017Cki pasuj\u0105c\u0105 do najbli\u017Cszej daty.\u0022,pt:\u0022Voc\u00EA pode inserir qualquer data no campo Personalizado, o New Recruit encontrar\u00E1 automaticamente a vers\u00E3o do livro correspondente \u00E0 data mais pr\u00F3xima.\u0022,hr:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,cz:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,sk:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022,gr:\u0022\u03A0\u03C1\u03BF\u03C3\u03B1\u03C1\u03BC\u03BF\u03C3\u03BC\u03AD\u03BD\u03B7 \u03C0\u03BB\u03B7\u03C1\u03BF\u03C6\u03BF\u03C1\u03AF\u03B1 \u03B7\u03BC\u03B5\u03C1\u03BF\u03BC\u03B7\u03BD\u03AF\u03B1\u03C2\u0022,ru:\u0022\u041F\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0437\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C\u0441\u043A\u0430\u044F \u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430\u0022,ko:\u0022You can enter any date in the Custom field, New Recruit will automatically find the version of the book matching the closest date.\u0022},rze={en:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,fr:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,es:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,cn:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,it:\u0022Aggiornamento Lista... Per favore non chiudere la finestra finch\u00E9 questo messaggio non scompare!\u0022,de:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,ja:\u0022\u30EA\u30B9\u30C8\u3092\u66F4\u65B0\u4E2D... \u3053\u306E\u30E1\u30C3\u30BB\u30FC\u30B8\u304C\u6D88\u3048\u308B\u307E\u3067\u30A6\u30A3\u30F3\u30C9\u30A6\u3092\u9589\u3058\u306A\u3044\u3067\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01\u0022,pl:\u0022Aktualizowanie Listy... Prosz\u0119 nie zamyka\u0107 okna, dop\u00F3ki ta wiadomo\u015B\u0107 nie zniknie!\u0022,pt:\u0022Atualizando Lista... Por favor, n\u00E3o feche a janela at\u00E9 que esta mensagem desapare\u00E7a!\u0022,hr:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,cz:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,sk:\u0022Updating List... Please don\u0027t close the window until this message disappears!\u0022,gr